# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Expert Fishing and Expert Cooking

step Expert Fishing
  tip Expert Fishing (cap 225) is a book, not a trainer rank: Expert Fishing - The Bass and You (1g), Old Man Heming (Stranglethorn Vale) sells it to both factions. Buy it and read it; it needs skill 125 and level 20. At level 20 the safe way to Booty Bay is the boat from Ratchet in The Barrens. Old Man Heming also sells Bright Baubles (+75 from skill 100, 2s 50c each), the lure for harder water. Forever's Fishing Rack (a camping item, from Fishing 140) is a blueprint that drops from Gelihast in Blackfathom Deeps.
  level 20
  train Fishing Expert "Buy and read Expert Fishing - The Bass and You (Expert Fishing)"

step Expert Cooking
  tip Expert Cooking (cap 225) is a book, not a trainer rank: Expert Cookbook (1g), sold by Shandrina (Ashenvale) for the Alliance and Wulan (Desolace) for the Horde. Buy it and read it; it needs skill 125 and level 20.
  level 20
  train Cooking Expert "Buy and read Expert Cookbook (Expert Cooking)"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Fishing 150-190

step Lures for Fishing 150-190
  only Alliance
  when !skill Fishing 225
  tip Some of these waters lose fish below Fishing 225: a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes. Bright Baubles (+75 from skill 100, 2s 50c each) closes the gap from 150: about 5 see you to 190 (48 minutes of fishing).
  buy 6532 x5 nearest

step Fishing 150-190
  only Alliance
  when !skill Cooking 175
  tip Fish the round until Fishing 190 and until your bags hold 80 Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish for the cooking: about 190 catches (from 75 a catch raises the skill less often: one in two by 100, one in seven by 225). The arrow takes the water that gets you there soonest from where you are, and picks again when you change zones: Ashenvale (Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish 42%); Stormwind City (Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish 21%); Stonetalon Mountains (Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish 44%); Redridge Mountains (Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish 65%); Stranglethorn Vale (Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish 20%). At each it leads stand to stand: stay while you catch fish (casting holds the arrow there), walk on when a pool is fished out or the spot is busy. Stranglethorn Vale loses fish below skill 225: keep a lure on the pole there until then. From level 7, Gilbert Gray at the Stormwind harbor gives Fishin' Time: bring 1 Shiny Bauble and 3 Nightcrawlers for cooked fish.
